::  name       comlink ipv6 dual stack
::  shape      policy - int (@u32)
::  invariant  when policy is 1, a host bind must offer both address families; this pedestal binds never dials; v4 and v6 address records stay sibling shapes (lens 4 and 16), never a union; any later family-choice wait is named and bounded (family_wait_ms=250)
::  example    1
::  readers    Comlink · Glow Tend · Sur museum · Ashvini nest-only
